          "question": "e-5578",
          "field": null,
          "attribute": "question/problem",
          "value": "Which of the following are orthogonal projection matrices?\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14071876/assets/5b3093e1c65624c862d949706ed5922ab8078beac752d4e7347c71be993580d8.png)",
