      "new_sha256": "c22155ed6ed12dd5a837fcf45c38c461e667dc733e1ed109e260e2b73dd98be6",
      "category": "ma_capture",
      "authoring": [],
      "source": [
        {
          "question": "e-5580",
          "field": null,
          "attribute": "question/problem",
          "value": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14071876/assets/21268cd488766dc03da672cb931f1678644d2ada5629c90a591058d6f5954347.png)\nGiven that the vector $\\mathbf{a}$ above spans $S^\\perp,$ and that $P$ is the orthogonal projection matrix of $\\mathbb{R}^3$ onto the subspace $S$, what is the value of $p_{13} + p_{32}?$",
